                                "sense_id": "a79dc225-dde9-3f85-91a7-e951bb61acb8",
                                "text": "She's in along with mother, talking about the college; it's to be biggered, sir."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c2fc14e1-4834-49e7-9a38-dfe6efd09e91",
                                "sense_id": "a79dc225-dde9-3f85-91a7-e951bb61acb8",
                                "text": "But I had to grow bigger. So bigger I got.\nI biggered my factory. I biggered my roads."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "920d83ec-2bef-46dc-8625-dad7dba08fdd",
                                "sense_id": "a79dc225-dde9-3f85-91a7-e951bb61acb8",
                                "text": "The money they splurged to the board's delight\nWill be spent biggering IT services, clean out of sight"
                            }
                        ]
